# Conformance probe pack for malformed input on the `bits` wire
# (spec/vector-format.md, "Malformed input"). Public. No kinds. Two words of
# four bytes, least-significant-bit-first, so the message is eight bytes.
format     conformance-malformed-bits
version    0.1.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md and spec/vector-format.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
wire       bits
word_bytes 4
field  time_ms   0:0:32  uint
field  stale_ms  1:0:32  uint
